{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_origen

    Under the head of a family, what they told us about how they heard of the centre and where they were measured to
    arrive from, side by side: people mistake where they heard of a centre, so neither corrects the other. Either may
    be missing. An AI assistant carries its stamp; a reader hears the whole sentence once.

    Example context (json):
    {"said": "Redes sociales", "site": "chatgpt.com", "ai": true,
        "text": "Nos dijeron «Redes sociales»; llegó desde chatgpt.com, un asistente de IA."}
}}
<div class="origen">
    <span class="oculto">{{text}}</span>
    {{#said}}<p class="origen-dicho" aria-hidden="true"><span class="origen-que">{{#str}}panel_origin_said, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><span class="origen-valor" dir="auto">{{said}}</span></p>{{/said}}
    {{#site}}<p class="origen-medido" aria-hidden="true"><span class="origen-que">{{#str}}panel_origin_measured, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span><span class="origen-valor" dir="ltr" translate="no">{{site}}</span>{{#ai}}<span class="sello-ia">{{#str}}panel_ai_stamp, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span>{{/ai}}</p>{{/site}}
</div>
